f04f8\" id=\"u976f04f8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3614a096\" id=\"u3614a096\">python-periphery</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue0aa33b6\" id=\"ue0aa33b6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\"> 库UART通讯功能。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"xhvHN\" id=\"xhvHN\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud12f4ca1\" id=\"ud12f4ca1\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">安装 python-periphery</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%9C%A8%E6%9D%BF%E5%8D%A1%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%5Cnsudo%20pip3%20install%20python-periphery%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vmpRB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"D5t3M\" id=\"D5t3M\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3299bb9b\" id=\"u3299bb9b\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">periphery使用UART功能</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%20python-periphery%20uart%20%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cnfrom%20periphery%20import%20Serial%5Cn%5Cntry%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E7%94%B3%E8%AF%B7%E4%B8%B2%E5%8F%A3%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90%2Fdev%2FttyS3%EF%BC%8C%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E4%B8%B2%E5%8F%A3%E6%B3%A2%E7%89%B9%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%BA115200%EF%BC%8C%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%BD%8D%E4%B8%BA8%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E6%A0%A1%E9%AA%8C%E4%BD%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%81%9C%